          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: 雪人",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "雪人 — xuěrén — \"snowman\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "门口有一个雪人 ménkǒu yǒu yí ge xuěrén — There's a snowman by the door."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 雪 (xuě) — eleven strokes in two pieces: 雨 pressed flat on top, eight strokes, and under it three bars joined on the right. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
